        <mxCell id="9lOXeYHIno6exo8iYPce-16" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;verticalAlign=top;align=left;" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;NbaDataManager&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;fetch_and_sync(date_string: str): &lt;/b&gt;Scarica risultati e boxscore della data in input e li aggiunge ai json.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Chiama&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;fetch_matchups()&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;fetch_boxscores()&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;sync_file() x2&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;sync_file(new_data: ?, filename: str): &lt;/b&gt;Gestisce l&#39;archiviazione dei dati evitando che lo stesso risulatato o lo stesso tabellino vengano salvati 2 volte&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;fetch_matchups(date_string: str):&lt;/b&gt; Scarica i matchup e i risultati per il giorno in input.&lt;br&gt;Chiama l&#39;endpoint&lt;/li&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;leagugamelog.LeagueGameLog()&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;fetch_boxscores(date_string): &lt;/b&gt;Scarica i boxscores per il giorno in input e i giocatori in player_ids&lt;br&gt;Chiama l&#39;endpoint&lt;/li&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;leagugamelog.LeagueGameLog()&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;download_all_players(): &lt;/b&gt;Restituisce tutti i giocatori (ID + Nome) che hanno un contratto attivo, scrivendo sul file all_players.json.&lt;br&gt;Chiama l&#39;endpoint&lt;/li&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;players.get_active_players()&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;fetch_players_info(player_ids, filename): &lt;/b&gt;Scarica info dettagliate (ID, Name, Team, Position) per una lista di&amp;nbsp; ID e salva sul file in input.&lt;br&gt;Chiama l&#39;endpoint&lt;/li&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;commonplayerinfo.CommonPlayerInfo()&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;get_players_ids_by_name(player_names_list: list[str]):&lt;/b&gt;&amp;nbsp;Riceve una lista di nomi e restituisce una lista di ID leggendo dal file all_players.json&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;" vertex="1">
