        <mxCell id="9lOXeYHIno6exo8iYPce-54" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;verticalAlign=top;align=left;" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;SupabaseSync&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;push_team(team: Team, court: Court):&lt;/b&gt;&amp;nbsp;Fa l&#39;upload (push) dello stato del team su Supabase&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;pull_team(team_name: str):&lt;/b&gt;&amp;nbsp;Fa il download dei dati da Supabase e ricostruisce l&#39;oggetto Team.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Istanzia&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Team,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Player x13&lt;br&gt;Chiama&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;add_player()&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;push_all_teams(team: Team, court: Court):&lt;/b&gt;&amp;nbsp;Carica tutte le squadre della lista su supabase&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
